{"id":"01a043f9-081c-74da-b3a5-8d63f9a45f96","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.2.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.2.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: protect_request (encrypt)\",\"notes\":\"Already implemented\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:45:56.630201Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T15:48:24.213238Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:09:08.307262Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T15:53:24.213238Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T15:48:24.213238Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.2.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.2\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:45:57.151165Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Reworked Zephyr oscore_protect_request around an explicit atomic sender-sequence reservation and context snapshot. All input/plaintext/output bounds and canonical OSCORE option construction complete before persistence; the next unused SSN is persisted before encryption; failures before durable persistence conditionally roll back only this reservation; context identity/key/IV/KID/KID Context/EUI are revalidated after the unlocked callback; caller lengths and option remain unpublished until encryption succeeds. Requests now include KID Context when present. The terminal RFC 8613 40-bit PIV 0xffffffffff is usable exactly once, with a 2^40 exhausted sentinel and non-underflowing remaining/freshness accounting. Added rollback/no-publish/NVM retry/max-PIV/replay regressions, fixed test SSN widths and a malformed Uri-Path fixture. Preserved concurrent response, replay, active-slot, and NVM hunks; untouched accumulated OSCORE hashes stayed stable. Gates: isolated qemu_x86 build/link PASS; all Zephyr OSCORE suites 33/33 PASS; Python OSCORE/parity 23 PASS; Rust lichen-oscore no-default-features 24 PASS, 1 ignored generator; relevant cppcheck PASS (one pre-existing const suggestion); git diff --check PASS. clang-format/clang-tidy unavailable locally.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T16:06:29.148318Z"}
{"id":"01a043f9-10e6-7445-9f5b-beb185aa878a","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.2.3","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"Implemented and verified durable request encryption, rollback/fail-before-publish behavior, canonical option construction, and terminal 40-bit PIV handling.","created_at":"2026-08-27T16:06:31.39828Z"}
